{"text":"kuruntokai","n":77,"lines":["அம்ம வாழி தோழி யாவதும்","தவறெனின் தவறோ இலவே வெஞ்சுரத்து","உலந்த வம்பலர் உவலிடு பதுக்கை","நெடுநல் யானைக் கிடுநிழ லாகும்","அரிய கானஞ் சென்றோர்க்கு","எளிய வாகிய தடமென் தோளே"],"tr":["amma vāḻi tōḻi yāvatum","tavaṟeṉiṉ tavaṟō ilavē veñcurattu","ulanta vampalar uvaliṭu patukkai","neṭunal yāṉaik kiṭuniḻa lākum","ariya kāṉañ ceṉṟōrkku","eḷiya vākiya taṭameṉ tōḷē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"மதுரை மருதன் இளநாகனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Maturai Marutaṉ Iḷanākaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"6 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"5×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 21, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 5, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அம்ம","tr":"amma","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ம","tr":"ma"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"யாவதும்","tr":"yāvatum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வதும்","tr":"vatum"}]}],[{"text":"தவறெனின்","tr":"tavaṟeṉiṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தவ","tr":"tava"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றெனின்","tr":"ṟeṉiṉ"}]},{"text":"தவறோ","tr":"tavaṟō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தவ","tr":"tava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோ","tr":"ṟō"}]},{"text":"இலவே","tr":"ilavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இல","tr":"ila"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"வெஞ்சுரத்து","tr":"veñcurattu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெஞ்","tr":"veñ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுரத்","tr":"curat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"உலந்த","tr":"ulanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உலந்","tr":"ulan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"வம்பலர்","tr":"vampalar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வம்","tr":"vam"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பலர்","tr":"palar"}]},{"text":"உவலிடு","tr":"uvaliṭu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உவ","tr":"uva"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிடு","tr":"liṭu"}]},{"text":"பதுக்கை","tr":"patukkai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பதுக்","tr":"patuk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]}],[{"text":"நெடுநல்","tr":"neṭunal","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடு","tr":"neṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"}]},{"text":"யானைக்","tr":"yāṉaik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னைக்","tr":"ṉaik"}]},{"text":"கிடுநிழ","tr":"kiṭuniḻa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிடு","tr":"kiṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிழ","tr":"niḻa"}]},{"text":"லாகும்","tr":"lākum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"அரிய","tr":"ariya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரி","tr":"ari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"கானஞ்","tr":"kāṉañ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னஞ்","tr":"ṉañ"}]},{"text":"சென்றோர்க்கு","tr":"ceṉṟōrkku","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சென்","tr":"ceṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோர்க்","tr":"ṟōrk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"எளிய","tr":"eḷiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"எளி","tr":"eḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"வாகிய","tr":"vākiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"தடமென்","tr":"taṭameṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தட","tr":"taṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மென்","tr":"meṉ"}]},{"text":"தோளே","tr":"tōḷē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"amma","gloss":"listen (interjection)"}],"gloss":"listen"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"vāḻi","gloss":"may you live"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"யாவதும்","parts":[{"text":"யாவது","lemma":"yāvatu","gloss":"any"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/at all"}],"gloss":"at all"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தவறு","parts":[{"text":"தவறு","lemma":"tavaṟu","gloss":"fault"}],"gloss":"fault"},{"surface":"எனின்","parts":[{"text":"எனின்","lemma":"eṉiṉ","gloss":"if said"}],"gloss":"if one says"},{"surface":"தவறோ","parts":[{"text":"தவறு","lemma":"tavaṟu","gloss":"fault"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"question marker"}],"gloss":"is it a fault?"},{"surface":"இலவே","parts":[{"text":"இல","lemma":"ila","gloss":"they are not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"there is none indeed"},{"surface":"வெஞ்சுரத்து","parts":[{"text":"வெஞ்சுரத்து","lemma":"வெஞ்சுரத்து","gloss":"in the hot desert"}],"gloss":"in the hot desert","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உலந்த","parts":[{"text":"உலந்த","lemma":"ula","gloss":"perished/dead"}],"gloss":"perished"},{"surface":"வம்பலர்","parts":[{"text":"வம்பலர்","lemma":"vampalar","gloss":"strangers/wayfarers"}],"gloss":"wayfarers"},{"surface":"உவலிடு","parts":[{"text":"உவல்","lemma":"uval","gloss":"dry leaves"},{"text":"இடு","lemma":"iṭu","gloss":"placed"}],"gloss":"covered with dry leaves"},{"surface":"பதுக்கை","parts":[{"text":"பதுக்கை","lemma":"patukkai","gloss":"cairn/grave heap"}],"gloss":"cairn"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடு","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"tall/long"}],"gloss":"tall"},{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good/fine"}],"gloss":"fine"},{"surface":"யானைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to (dative)"}],"gloss":"to the elephant"},{"surface":"இடு","parts":[{"text":"இடு","lemma":"iṭu","gloss":"giving/casting"}],"gloss":"casting"},{"surface":"நிழல்","parts":[{"text":"நிழல்","lemma":"niḻal","gloss":"shade"}],"gloss":"shade"},{"surface":"ஆகும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகும்","lemma":"āku","gloss":"which becomes"}],"gloss":"which becomes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரிய","parts":[{"text":"அரிய","lemma":"ariya","gloss":"difficult"}],"gloss":"difficult"},{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"kāṉam","gloss":"forest/desert"}],"gloss":"desert forest"},{"surface":"சென்றோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"சென்றோர்","lemma":"ceṉṟōr","gloss":"those who went"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to (dative)"}],"gloss":"to him who went"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எளிய","parts":[{"text":"எளிய","lemma":"eḷiya","gloss":"easy/weak/withered"}],"gloss":"easy/withered"},{"surface":"ஆகிய","parts":[{"text":"ஆகிய","lemma":"ākiya","gloss":"which became"}],"gloss":"which became"},{"surface":"தட","parts":[{"text":"தட","lemma":"taṭa","gloss":"broad/large"}],"gloss":"broad"},{"surface":"மென்","parts":[{"text":"மென்","lemma":"meṉ","gloss":"soft"}],"gloss":"soft"},{"surface":"தோளே","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"tōḷ","gloss":"shoulder"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed (emphasis)"}],"gloss":"shoulders indeed"}]}],"literal":"Listen, may you live long, friend! At all / if one says fault, is it a fault? There is none indeed! In the hot desert, / the dry-leaf-covered cairns of perished wayfarers / become the casting shade for the tall, fine elephants. / To him who went to that difficult desert forest, / my broad, soft shoulders became easy (wasted).","translation":"Listen, my friend, may you live long! If you say there is any fault on his part, is it really a fault? No, there is none. In the hot desert, where the leaf-covered stone cairns of perished wayfarers offer the only shade to tall, fine elephants, he has gone. To him who journeyed into that difficult wilderness, my broad, soft shoulders have become so easy to leave behind, wasting away in his absence.","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! என் தலைவன் மீது ஏதேனும் தவறு இருக்கிறது என்று கூறினால், அது உண்மையில் தவறா? ஒரு தவறும் இல்லை. இறந்த வழிப்போக்கர்களின் மீது இலைகளால் மூடப்பட்ட கல் பதுக்கைகள், பெரிய நல்ல யானைகளுக்கு நிழல் தரும் இடமாக விளங்கும் வெம்மையான பாலைவனத்திற்குச் சென்ற என் தலைவனுக்கு, என்னுடைய பருத்த மென்மையான தோள்கள் எளிதாகக் கைவிடப்பட்டு மெலிந்து போயின.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her confidante (tōḻi) who blames the hero for leaving her to go to the desert in search of wealth. The heroine defends her lover, saying that he is not at fault. She describes the harsh desert (pālai tiṇai) where the only shade available for the great elephants is the stone cairns (patukkai) of dead travelers covered with dry leaves. This grim image highlights the extreme danger and difficulty of the path he has taken. She concludes that the fault lies not with him, but with her own broad, soft shoulders which were so 'easy' (eḷiya) to be abandoned and have now wasted away in grief.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}